{"id":"ceab247000d7caa9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets.md","title":"可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举","display":"thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets — 可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets","aliases":["20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets"],"display":"thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets — 可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.6.8","source_printed_pages":[48],"source_pdf_pages":[84],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-index-list-computable-sets — 可计算集合有有效的 c.e. 索引全列举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.6.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；集合列用 c.e. 索引表示。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}index\\text{-}list\\text{-}computable\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\{W_{f(e)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal R].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}index\\text{-}list\\text{-}computable\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\{W_{f(e)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal R].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一枚举 W_e，只保留每次大于全部已保留成员的新纪录。若只有有限纪录，输出为有限集；若无限，纪录序列严格递增且可计算，其值域可计算。任意无限可计算集合可按递增顺序有效枚举，因而对这样的 W_e 全部成员均被保留；有限集亦可按递增顺序枚举。故输出集合恰为全部可计算集合。此处只列举 c.e. 索引；没有统一产生特征索引，因此不违反总可计算函数不可有效全列举的对角定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.6.8；印刷页 48；PDF 第 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-d